16	/**
17	 * Rule-engine distillation, architecture 4.2. Profiles are yaml specs in
18	 * profiles/; every distillation decision is audited; a gate failure serves
19	 * raw. No LLM anywhere in this phase (see llm.ts for the Phase 5 hook).
